[[0,56695,0,22,0,22,"2015-02-25T23:20:51","Atko","",[],"<p>Frontpage listings are a bit hard for me to read with current voat style (both light and dark).</p>\n<p>What do you guys think about adding a minor highlight like this?</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/bHLs3OH.png\">Light with highlight</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/NF1es1r.png\">Dark with highlight</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://preview.voat.co/user/nurdoidz\">@nurdoidz</a> - <a href=\"https://preview.voat.co/user/puttiout\">@puttiout</a> - <a href=\"https://preview.voat.co/user/danielflamino\">@danielflamino</a> &amp; everyone else - I'd love some feedback - yay or nay?</p>","Thoughts on this minor highlighting change?","","voatdev"],[1,80625,0,8,0,8,"2015-02-25T23:22:44","cthulhuandyou","",[],"<p>Looks good to me. Definitely helps the readability, I think.</p>"],[1,80666,0,7,0,7,"2015-02-25T23:57:25","Nurdoidz","",[],"<p>It took me a while to notice what the difference was, but now I see. It's the alternating background colors, right? I really like and support the idea, but I'd say they need to contrast more.</p>"],[2,101034,80666,2,0,2,"2015-03-21T06:27:04","tanglisha","",[],"<p>Wow, I didn't even notice there WAS zebra striping on the front page.</p>"],[1,82554,0,2,0,2,"2015-02-28T00:01:35","Anchy","",[],"<p>It's in those little things :)</p>\n<p>Yet so small, and yet so useful</p>"]]
